BT 1 0 0 1 8 182.4 Tm /F3 7.6 Tf 10 TL (# README.md) Tj T* (# ComicCraft AI) Tj T*  T* (## Description) Tj T* (ComicCraft AI helps users turn a story idea into a comic-panel outline.) Tj T*  T* (## Main Features) Tj T* (- Accepts a story prompt) Tj T* (- Produces a simple sequence of panels) Tj T* (- Displays a basic narration for each panel) Tj T*  T* (## Run) Tj T* (1. Install Python 3.) Tj T* (2. Open the project folder in VS Code.) Tj T* (3. Run: python comiccraft_demo.py) Tj T*  T* (## Note) Tj T* (This prototype creates text panels. AI-generated images require) Tj T* (integration with an image-generation service.) Tj T* ET
